{"title":"Lightning in the Mine","html":"<article class=\"wp g-page\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\"><span class=\"q-alert-banner\" role=\"alert\"><svg class=\"q-alert-ico\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3 2 21h20z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M12 10v5M12 17.6v.4\" stroke=\"#1b1300\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg><span><b>This quest is not fully written yet.</b> Steps, items or dialogue may be missing.</span></span>Kobold shamans in Frostvein hang storm fetishes on the tunnel walls. The Surveyor wants to know what they are before his crew walks into one.</p><section id=\"g-about\"><h2>About</h2><div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-facts\"><thead><tr><th></th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Given by</td><td><a href=\"#/npc/surveyor\">Surveyor</a> <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"surveyor\">Show on map</button></td></tr><tr><td>Level</td><td>17</td></tr><tr><td>Length</td><td>Long</td></tr><tr><td>Kind</td><td>Side</td></tr><tr><td>Quest points</td><td>1</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section id=\"g-needs\"><h2>What you need</h2><ul class=\"q-needs\"><li><a href=\"#/item/storm-fetish\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/gen/06a210fb17dae7056228.svg\" alt=\"\">Storm Fetish</a> <b>×3</b></li></ul></section><section id=\"g-steps\"><h2>Steps</h2><ol class=\"q-steps\"><li value=\"1\">Talk to <a href=\"#/npc/surveyor\">Surveyor</a> <span class=\"muted\">(outdoors around -667, -479)</span> to get the quest. <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"surveyor\">Show on map</button></li><li value=\"2\">Kobold shamans in Frostvein <span class=\"muted\">(6)</span><br>Storm fetishes <span class=\"muted\">(3)</span> - <a href=\"#/item/storm-fetish\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/gen/06a210fb17dae7056228.svg\" alt=\"\">Storm Fetish</a> <span class=\"muted\">at -667, -479</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"spot\" data-map-id=\"-667|-479|Storm fetishes\">Show on map</button></li></ol></section><section id=\"g-rewards\"><h2>Rewards</h2><div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-rewards\"><thead><tr><th>Reward</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Gold</td><td>1,024</td></tr><tr><td>Character XP</td><td>32,000</td></tr><tr><td>Quest points</td><td>1</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section id=\"g-talk\"><h2>What Surveyor says</h2><div class=\"q-conv\"><p class=\"q-npc\"><b>Surveyor:</b> Bone, copper wire and a scrap of fur. That&#39;s all it is. Put your hand near it.</p><p class=\"q-npc\"><b>Surveyor:</b> Feel that? They&#39;ve found a way to keep a storm in a bundle. I don&#39;t want that left anywhere in a mine.</p><p class=\"q-npc\"><b>Surveyor:</b> The warden has been waiting to hear about this. Go and see her.</p></div></section><section id=\"g-end\"><h2>Handing it in</h2><p class=\"q-end\"><i>\"The warden has been waiting to hear about this. Go and see her.\"</i></p></section></div>\n      <aside class=\"wp-infobox g-aside\"><h3>Lightning in the Mine</h3><p class=\"g-aside-group\">Quests</p><p class=\"g-aside-h\">On this page</p><ol class=\"g-toc\"><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-north-lightning-in-the-mine\" data-g-jump=\"g-about\">About</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-north-lightning-in-the-mine\" data-g-jump=\"g-needs\">What you need</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-north-lightning-in-the-mine\" data-g-jump=\"g-steps\">Steps</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-north-lightning-in-the-mine\" data-g-jump=\"g-rewards\">Rewards</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-north-lightning-in-the-mine\" data-g-jump=\"g-talk\">What Surveyor says</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-north-lightning-in-the-mine\" data-g-jump=\"g-end\">Handing it in</a></li></ol><p class=\"g-aside-h\">Related guides</p><ul class=\"g-toc\"><li><a href=\"#/guide/quests\">All quests</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/travel\">Travel &amp; quests</a></li></ul><p class=\"g-aside-h\"><a href=\"#/guides\">All guides</a></p><p class=\"g-note\">From the game’s own data, what players have recorded, and the <a href=\"https://binxonia.com/guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">official guide</a>.</p></aside></article>"}